    <ol>
      <li><strong>Respect the Fail-Closed Gate (<code>slot_authorized = false</code>):</strong> Do not spend a live DrivenData weekly slot on this artifact while the literal all-registry rule includes the <code>206,895</code>-dot <code>13GEMSDOE r13-lattice-s5</code> uniform grid probe (<code>99.99%</code> unfiltered / <code>99.77%</code> off-catalogue 3-px overlap; a selector cannot waive the literal stop). Across all <code>87</code> genuine geological fault detectors, max 3-px overlap is <code>57.14% &le; 70%</code>.</li>
      <li><strong>Inspect Both Local Encoding Profiles (<code>-zeros.tif</code> vs <code>-nan.tif</code>):</strong><br>
